{"id":"f35aac82e2971e68","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-frege-system.md","title":"Frege System","display":"df-frege-system — Frege System","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-frege-system","aliases":["72-df-frege-system"],"display":"df-frege-system — Frege System","depends_on":["[[72-df-propositional-syntax]]"],"source_location":"Pudlak, Chapter VIII, Definitions 8.1.1-8.1.2; printed p. 591; PDF p. 603","source_statement_status":"source-statement-compared","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"source_proof_status":"not-applicable-definition; local well-definedness and referenced interfaces checked","round2_verification_status":"definition-contract-checked","verification_status":"definition-contract-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-frege-system"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-frege-system</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-frege-system — Frege System"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d6da6d3f3489ef90\" href=\"?note=d6da6d3f3489ef90\" title=\"72-df-propositional-syntax\">72-df-propositional-syntax</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Pudlak, Chapter VIII, Definitions 8.1.1-8.1.2; printed p. 591; PDF p. 603"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"source-statement-compared"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-applicable-definition; local well-definedness and referenced interfaces checked"},{"key":"round2_verification_status","html":"definition-contract-checked"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-contract-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Fml},\\mathsf{Sub},\\widehat\\sigma,\\models\">\\(\\mathsf{Fml},\\mathsf{Sub},\\widehat\\sigma,\\models\\)</span> 如 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d6da6d3f3489ef90\" href=\"?note=d6da6d3f3489ef90\" title=\"72-df-propositional-syntax\">72-df-propositional-syntax</a>；固定该节点的有限完备联结词基。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Fml})\\times\\mathsf{Fml}\">\\(R\\subseteq\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Fml})\\times\\mathsf{Fml}\\)</span> 为有限规则模式集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H,S,\\Gamma\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Fml})\">\\(H,S,\\Gamma\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Fml})\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fml}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fml}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Fml}^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Fml}^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FregeRule}(\\Gamma,A)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\Gamma\\models A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FregeRule}(\\Gamma,A)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\Gamma\\models A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Step}_R(H,A)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\exists(\\Gamma,B)\\in R\\;\\exists\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Sub}\\;\n\\bigl(\\{\\widehat\\sigma(C):C\\in\\Gamma\\}\\subseteq H\\land\\widehat\\sigma(B)=A\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Step}_R(H,A)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\exists(\\Gamma,B)\\in R\\;\\exists\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Sub}\\;\n\\bigl(\\{\\widehat\\sigma(C):C\\in\\Gamma\\}\\subseteq H\\land\\widehat\\sigma(B)=A\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{FregeProof}(R,S,\\pi,A)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;&amp;\n\\operatorname{lh}(\\pi)&gt;0\\land\\pi_{\\operatorname{lh}(\\pi)-1}=A\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(\\pi)\\;\n\\bigl(\\pi_i\\in S\\lor\\operatorname{Step}_R(\\{\\pi_j:j&lt;i\\},\\pi_i)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{FregeProof}(R,S,\\pi,A)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;&amp;\n\\operatorname{lh}(\\pi)&gt;0\\land\\pi_{\\operatorname{lh}(\\pi)-1}=A\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(\\pi)\\;\n\\bigl(\\pi_i\\in S\\lor\\operatorname{Step}_R(\\{\\pi_j:j&lt;i\\},\\pi_i)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Frege}(R)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;&amp;\n\\forall(\\Gamma,A)\\in R\\;\\operatorname{FregeRule}(\\Gamma,A)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall S\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Fml})\\;\\forall A\\in\\mathsf{Fml}\\;\n\\bigl(S\\models A\\to\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Fml}^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\operatorname{FregeProof}(R,S,\\pi,A)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Frege}(R)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;&amp;\n\\forall(\\Gamma,A)\\in R\\;\\operatorname{FregeRule}(\\Gamma,A)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall S\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Fml})\\;\\forall A\\in\\mathsf{Fml}\\;\n\\bigl(S\\models A\\to\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Fml}^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\operatorname{FregeProof}(R,S,\\pi,A)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"R,S\\vdash A\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Fml}^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\operatorname{FregeProof}(R,S,\\pi,A),\\qquad\nR\\vdash A\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;R,\\varnothing\\vdash A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[R,S\\vdash A\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Fml}^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\operatorname{FregeProof}(R,S,\\pi,A),\\qquad\nR\\vdash A\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;R,\\varnothing\\vdash A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>来源：Chapter VIII，Definitions 8.1.1–8.1.2，印刷页 591，PDF 页 603。这里按原书的一般有限 Frege 规则和蕴涵完备性定义，修正了原先把全部 Frege 系统局限为 modus ponens 加公理模式的表述。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Gamma=\\varnothing\\)</span> 的规则就是公理模式；规则的每一次应用都同时代入，但不能对任意已经推导的公式直接施行代入规则。后一规则属于 substitution Frege。</li>\n<li>本次核对了定义陈述。规则的有限前提、同时代入及已有前提集合在形式签名中明确给出；没有证明任意给定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 具备蕴涵完备性。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-propositional-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"d6da6d3f3489ef90","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-propositional-syntax]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-propositional-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"d6da6d3f3489ef90","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathsf{Fml},\\mathsf{Sub},\\widehat\\sigma,\\models$ 如 [[72-df-propositional-syntax]]；固定该节点的有限完备联结词基。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf{Fml},\\mathsf{Sub},\\widehat\\sigma,\\models","display":false},{"tex":"R\\subseteq\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Fml})\\times\\mathsf{Fml}","display":false},{"tex":"H,S,\\Gamma\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Fml})","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fml}","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Fml}^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FregeRule}(\\Gamma,A)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\Gamma\\models A.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Step}_R(H,A)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\exists(\\Gamma,B)\\in R\\;\\exists\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Sub}\\;\n\\bigl(\\{\\widehat\\sigma(C):C\\in\\Gamma\\}\\subseteq H\\land\\widehat\\sigma(B)=A\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{FregeProof}(R,S,\\pi,A)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;&\n\\operatorname{lh}(\\pi)>0\\land\\pi_{\\operatorname{lh}(\\pi)-1}=A\\\\\n&\\land\\forall i<\\operatorname{lh}(\\pi)\\;\n\\bigl(\\pi_i\\in S\\lor\\operatorname{Step}_R(\\{\\pi_j:j<i\\},\\pi_i)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Frege}(R)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;&\n\\forall(\\Gamma,A)\\in R\\;\\operatorname{FregeRule}(\\Gamma,A)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall S\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Fml})\\;\\forall A\\in\\mathsf{Fml}\\;\n\\bigl(S\\models A\\to\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Fml}^{<\\omega}\\;\\operatorname{FregeProof}(R,S,\\pi,A)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"R,S\\vdash A\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Fml}^{<\\omega}\\;\\operatorname{FregeProof}(R,S,\\pi,A),\\qquad\nR\\vdash A\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;R,\\varnothing\\vdash A.","display":true},{"tex":"\\Gamma=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false}],"bytes":2732,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53ee8b5af941c0e","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Frege}(R)$，$\\operatorname{Step}_R$ 如 [[72-df-frege-system]]；$\\mathsf{PV},\\mathsf{Fml},\\operatorname{Var}$ 如 [[72-df-propositional-syntax]]。"},{"id":"dadbe463a5c99c0a","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Frege}(R)$ 及 $\\operatorname{Step}_R$ 如 [[72-df-frege-system]]；$\\mathsf{Sub},\\widehat\\sigma$ 如 [[72-df-propositional-syntax]]。"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-377","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-frege-system|df-frege-system — Frege System]]"},{"id":"c8e040945cb1c335","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Frege}(R)$，$R\\vdash\\varphi\\to\\psi$，可证性如 [[72-df-frege-system]]。"},{"id":"b07cf6e91885e3f6","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Frege}(R)$，$\\operatorname{SFProof}$，$\\operatorname{EFProof}$ 分别如 [[72-df-frege-system]]、[[72-df-substitution-frege]]、[[72-df-extended-frege]]。"}],"outgoing":["d6da6d3f3489ef90"]}